  "title": "Passover Apple Cake",
  "description": "Want a cake recipe for Passover? This one uses apples, brown sugar, cinnamon, nutmeg, oil, and matzo. It might be the best apple cake you'll ever taste.",
  "authors": [
    "Shelley Ross"
  ],
